#: ../UpdateManager/Dialogs.py:331
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"There will not be any further Ubuntu releases for this system's '%s' "
"architecture.\n"
"\n"
"Updates for Ubuntu %s will continue until 2023-04-26.\n"
"\n"
"If you reinstall Ubuntu from ubuntu.com/download, future upgrades will be "
"available."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Nun habrá más publicaciones d'Ubuntu pa la arquitectura «%s» d'esti "
"sistema.\n"
"\n"
"Los anovamientos pa Ubuntu %s siguirán  hasta'l 26-04-2023.\n"
"\n"
"Si reinstales Ubuntu dende ubuntu.com/download, tendrás a mano futuros "
"anovamientos."

#: ../UpdateManager/Dialogs.py:347
msgid "Not all updates can be installed"
msgstr "Nun puen instalase tolos anovamientos"

#: ../UpdateManager/Dialogs.py:350
msgid ""
"Run a partial upgrade, to install as many updates as possible.\n"
"\n"
"    This can be caused by:\n"
"     * A previous upgrade which didn't complete\n"
"     * Problems with some of the installed software\n"
"     * Unofficial software packages not provided by Ubuntu\n"
"     * Normal changes of a pre-release version of Ubuntu"
msgstr ""
"Executa un anovamientu parcial pa instalar tantos anovamientos como seyan "
"posibles.\n"
"\n"
"    Esto pue tar causao por:\n"
"     * Un anovamientu anterior que nun se completó\n"
"     * Problemes con dellos de los programes instalaos\n"
"     * Paquetes de software non oficiales que nun tán apurríos por Ubuntu\n"
"     * Camudancies normales d'una versión de prellanzamientu d'Ubuntu"

#: ../UpdateManager/Dialogs.py:361
